From fb82065f16345879e1a95909c446aa01ce326cc1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel Illescas Romero <illescas.daniel@protonmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 13:26:13 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 59/64] Frame pacer (absolute deadlines, sleep+spin), r_vsync
 modes, sub-ms cgame interpolation.

Adds Sys_WaitUntil, monotonic Sys_Milliseconds on Linux, com_maxfpsPrecise/Mode/GpuSync/SpinUs,
renderer PresentWait/PresentDone hooks around the buffer swap, live r_vsync 0-4
(off/on/adaptive/triple buffer/low latency) and cg_subMsecLerp. Legacy limiter unchanged when off.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
